{"s":88,"v":[{"t":"Has there reached you the report of the Overwhelming [event]?","w":[["هَلْ","Has","hal",""],["أَتَىٰكَ","(there) come to you","atāka","",[["أَتَىٰ",62],["كَ",18]]],["حَدِيثُ","(the) news","ḥadīthu",""],["ٱلْغَـٰشِيَةِ","(of) the Overwhelming","l-ghāshiyati","",[["ٱلْ",2],["غَـٰشِيَةِ",1912]]]]},{"t":"[Some] faces, that Day, will be humbled,","w":[["وُجُوهٌۭ","Faces","wujūhun",""],["يَوْمَئِذٍ","that Day","yawma-idhin","",[["يَوْمَ",33],["ئِذٍ",50]]],["خَـٰشِعَةٌ","(will be) humbled","khāshiʿatun",""]]},{"t":"Working [hard] and exhausted.","w":[["عَامِلَةٌۭ","Laboring","ʿāmilatun",""],["نَّاصِبَةٌۭ","exhausted","nāṣibatun",""]]},{"t":"They will [enter to] burn in an intensely hot Fire.","w":[["تَصْلَىٰ","They will burn","taṣlā",""],["نَارًا","(in) a Fire","nāran",""],["حَامِيَةًۭ","intensely hot","ḥāmiyatan",""]]},{"t":"They will be given drink from a boiling spring.","w":[["تُسْقَىٰ","They will be given to drink","tus'qā",""],["مِنْ","from","min",""],["عَيْنٍ","a spring","ʿaynin",""],["ءَانِيَةٍۢ","boiling","āniyatin",""]]},{"t":"For them there will be no food except from a poisonous, thorny plant","w":[["لَّيْسَ","Not is","laysa",""],["لَهُمْ","for them","lahum","",[["لَ",8],["هُمْ",3]]],["طَعَامٌ","food","ṭaʿāmun",""],["إِلَّا","except","illā",""],["مِن","from","min",""],["ضَرِيعٍۢ","a bitter thorny plant","ḍarīʿin",""]]},{"t":"Which neither nourishes nor avails against hunger.","w":[["لَّا","Not","lā",""],["يُسْمِنُ","it nourishes","yus'minu",""],["وَلَا","and not","walā","",[["وَ",1],["لَا",13]]],["يُغْنِى","it avails","yugh'nī",""],["مِن","from","min",""],["جُوعٍۢ","hunger","jūʿin",""]]},{"t":"[Other] faces, that Day, will show pleasure.","w":[["وُجُوهٌۭ","Faces","wujūhun",""],["يَوْمَئِذٍۢ","that Day","yawma-idhin","",[["يَوْمَ",33],["ئِذٍۢ",50]]],["نَّاعِمَةٌۭ","(will be) joyful","nāʿimatun",""]]},{"t":"With their effort [they are] satisfied","w":[["لِّسَعْيِهَا","With their effort","lisaʿyihā","",[["لِّ",8],["سَعْيِ",828],["هَا",22]]],["رَ